  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.RadixOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to Radix -- asset-centric blockchain built for DeFi with Cerberus BFT consensus, Radix Engine v2, and native asset types that eliminate common smart contract vulnerabilities. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and resources. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Derive real MultiversX and Cardano keys; share Bech32 and SLIP-10 (9fa7d2f)\n- Derive real Radix Ed25519 keys and account addresses (6b935bd)\n- Prepare verified Radix CQL demo release excluding unqualified TRON (21f20b2)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.RadixOASIS",
